1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Narrator: Listen to a history teacher talking to a class.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:08,210
Teacher: For this unit, we're going to do something a little bit different.

3
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:12,620
Instead of writing a paper about the time period we just discussed

4
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:15,230
we're going to put on a play about it.

5
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:19,170
I'd like you to get into groups and each write one scene.

6
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:25,260
This scene should show something important that happened during the 19th century.
